// +------------+---------+---------+----------+
// |            | Canal A | Canal B | Canal C  |
// +------------+---------+---------+----------+
// | Frecuencia | Timer 0 | Timer 1 | Timer 3  |
// | PW+        | Timer 5 | Timer 4 | Timer 8  |
// | PW-        | Timer 7 | Timer 6 | Timer 10 |
// | Cont. puls.|         |         | Timer 0  |
// +------------+---------+---------+----------+
// En tratamiento TB el Timer 0 tamb�en se utiliza como contador de pulsos

// +---------+-------+-------+
// |         | PW +  | PW -  |
// +---------+-------+-------+
// | Canal A | PWM 7 | PWM 6 |
// | Canal B | PWM 9 | PWM 8 |
// | Canal C | PWM 5 | PWM 4 |
// +---------+-------+-------+

// +-----------------------------+-----------------------------+-----------------------------+
// |     Electr�nica Canal A     |     Electr�nica Canal B     |     Electr�nica Canal C    |
// +-----------------------------+-----------------------------+-----------------------------+
// | Electroestimulaci�n Canal A | Electroestimulaci�n Canal B | Electroestimulaci�n Canal C|
// | Pointer                     | Transcraneal                 | Sistema Multipulsos         |
// |                             | Galv�nica                   |                             |
// |                             | Galv�nica + microcorrientes |                             |
// +-----------------------------+-----------------------------+-----------------------------+

